### 1. Register akun baru
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alya.tif20@example.com",
  "password": "AlyaTugas20!2026"
}

### 2. Register dengan email yang sama (uji duplikat)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alya.tif20@example.com",
  "password": "AlyaTugas20!2026"
}

### 3. Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alya.tif20@example.com",
  "password": "AlyaTugas20!2026"
}

### 4. Melihat daftar buku (endpoint publik)
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### 5. Melihat daftar peminjaman (endpoint publik)
GET http://localhost:3000/loans

### 6. Melihat profil tanpa token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/saya

### 7. Menambahkan buku tanpa token
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buku Uji Tanpa Token",
  "author": "Alya Rasyida",
  "isbn": "9786230000001",
  "year": 2026,
  "price": 75000,
  "stock": 10,
  "publishedAt": "2026-01-01"
}

### 8. Menambahkan buku dengan token
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_LOGIN

{
  "title": "Buku Pengujian Autentikasi",
  "author": "Alya Rasyida",
  "isbn": "9786230000003",
  "year": 2026,
  "price": 75000,
  "stock": 10,
  "publishedAt": "2026-01-01"
}

### 9. Melihat profil dengan token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_LOGIN

### 10. Menambahkan peminjaman tanpa token
POST http://localhost:3000/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "borrowerName": "Alya",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 11. Menambahkan peminjaman dengan token
POST http://localhost:3000/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_LOGIN

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "borrowerName": "Alya",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 12. Mengubah data buku dengan token
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_LOGIN

{
  "title": "Laskar Pelangi Edisi Revisi",
  "author": "Andrea Hirata",
  "isbn": "9786022912792",
  "year": 2005,
  "price": 90000,
  "stock": 13,
  "publishedAt": "2005-01-01"
}

### 13. Menghapus buku dengan token
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/8
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_LOGIN
### 14. Menguji token JWT palsu
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_PALSU_HASIL_UJI
### 15. Menguji token JWT kedaluwarsa
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/saya
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_KEDALUWARSA_HASIL_UJI
### 16. Menguji validasi register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "email-tidak-valid",
  "password": "123"
}

